      "content": "Hey, I need help drafting a 5-day itinerary for an exec traveling through SE Asia next month. They're hitting Singapore, Bangkok, and Ho Chi Minh City for meetings. Can you put together a tight schedule that handles the flights/transfers between those cities efficiently and includes some high-end business hotels? Needs to be very professional/logistics-focused.",
